-9909-4e55-ba35-142e92272d11" endid="#m-7ab7b34a-d957-4cbb-9a13-376df9990952" type="emendation" corresp="#m-comment-3"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-3-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>(wie 1A)</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-3-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-3bcbc395-93fe-42c4-b5fe-83635a93edb3" endid="#m-a63eabdd-ee0e-4dd0-a580-dbebeeee109c" type="emendation" corresp="#m-comment-4"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-4-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>(wie 1A)</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-4-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-2369a1f3-5faf-4cb3-885a-2e7513eb4c21" endid="#m-de90c52a-d1fc-4606-9535-47b6a772b760" corresp="#m-comment-5"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-5-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>(wie 1A)</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>unklarer Befund, bis zum Zeilenwechsel</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-5-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>, nach dem Zeilenwechsel (Kustos im Einklang) ist c-Schlüssel und -Linie eine Stufe tiefer gesetzt als zu erwarten.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-bb7bcf02-bf6b-45b5-84b2-b86a06fcde2b" endid="#m-bb7bcf02-bf6b-45b5-84b2-b86a06fcde2b"><table><tr><td><rend>[[-ley-]]</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Notation vermutlich radiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-32da9d42-66e5-409d-8339-dc0b91acf9ed" endid="#m-32da9d42-66e5-409d-8339-dc0b91acf9ed" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((-son))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>folgt fälschlich [[Chri&lt;steleyson&gt;]] o.N.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-cf4665d8-5a25-4ee2-be1f-eeb8681902ab" endid="#m-5bbff44d-e90e-42fe-b5dc-0343c1e9fd65" corresp="#m-comment-8"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-8-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>die ursprünglich Notation der letzten Silbe offenbar radiert, eine späte Hand korrigiert zu</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-8-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-f0df2993-ba16-4d2a-8dfa-5b010ea2a181" endid="#m-f0df2993-ba16-4d2a-8dfa-5b010ea2a181" corresp="#m-comment-9"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-9-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-9-notes-1"/></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><table><tr><td><rend>((1A-3C2:)) Hexameter (((eleison)) steht teils innerhalb, teils außerhalb des Verses).</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Melodieschema:</rend></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td><table><tr><td><rend>a</rend></td><td><rend>a</rend></td><td><rend>a</rend></td><td><rend>b</rend></td><td><rend>b</rend></td><td><rend>b</rend></td><td><rend>c</rend></td><td><rend>c</rend></td><td><rend>c'</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>1A</rend></td><td><rend>1C</rend></td><td><rend>1B</rend></td><td><rend>2A</rend></td><td><rend>2C</rend></td><td><rend>2B</rend></td><td><rend>3A</rend></td><td><rend>3B</rend></td><td><rend>3C1 3C2 2C3</rend></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Eine spätere Hand fügt vor 1C das Textinzipit ((Fons et origo)) ein, vor 2C ((Plasmatis)), vor 3A ((Procedens)). Damit soll vermutlich die Reihenfolge der Texte korrigiert werden zu: 1A 1B 1C 2A 2B 2C 3B 3A 3C1 3C2 3C3.</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Zur Melodieüberlieferung vgl. ((Beneventanum Troporum Corpus II, 1,)) Edition S. 70-73 und Kommentar S. 26-27.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-ben-34"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Ben 34</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Ben 34-185v-1</identifier><title>Cunctipotens genitor</title><incip><incipText><p>Cunctipotens genitor</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="185v">f. 185v, l. 1</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 47, 4: 1A 1C 1B 2A 2C 2B 3A 3B 